1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:02,250
Every prediction market starts empty.

2
00:00:02,250 --> 00:00:03,850
No price, no counterparty.

3
00:00:03,850 --> 00:00:07,450
A fifteen-minute market does that ninety-six times a day.

4
00:00:07,450 --> 00:00:09,850
Nobody has solved the cold start.

5
00:00:10,850 --> 00:00:12,119
Converge ends it.

6
00:00:12,119 --> 00:00:15,504
Liquidity becomes infrastructure: deposit once into one vault,

7
00:00:15,504 --> 00:00:18,888
and it makes the market in every round,

8
00:00:18,888 --> 00:00:21,850
on every asset, from the first second.

9
00:00:22,850 --> 00:00:25,650
Faster traders hunt on-chain quotes: our first

10
00:00:25,650 --> 00:00:28,050
design lost eighty-eight dollars a day.

11
00:00:28,050 --> 00:00:30,850
So orders now fill two seconds later,

12
00:00:30,850 --> 00:00:33,650
at the oracle's price for that second.

13
00:00:33,650 --> 00:00:36,450
About fifty dollars a day, in backtest.

14
00:00:36,450 --> 00:00:38,850
It breaks at a three-second lead.

15
00:00:38,850 --> 00:00:40,050
We say so.

16
00:00:41,050 --> 00:00:43,097
Watch a new user.

17
00:00:43,097 --> 00:00:47,190
Face ID creates the account, no seed phrase.

18
00:00:47,190 --> 00:00:50,771
Add test money, tap Up, confirm once.

19
00:00:50,771 --> 00:00:52,817
The keeper fills it.

20
00:00:52,817 --> 00:00:55,887
Eighteen point seven seconds, landing page

21
00:00:55,887 --> 00:00:58,957
to live bet, on Monad testnet.

22
00:00:58,957 --> 00:01:03,050
Ethereum, Bitcoin, MON: one vault quotes them all.

23
00:01:04,050 --> 00:01:06,450
Monad's blocks take three hundred milliseconds.

24
00:01:06,450 --> 00:01:10,050
Serving a trade costs a sixth of a cent.

25
00:01:10,050 --> 00:01:12,050
On Ethereum, about ten cents.

26
00:01:13,050 --> 00:01:14,471
Chainlink CRE orchestrates.

27
00:01:14,471 --> 00:01:18,734
Kuru lists each Up token as an order book.

28
00:01:18,734 --> 00:01:19,682
Envio indexes.

29
00:01:19,682 --> 00:01:22,050
Mera is the account layer.

30
00:01:23,050 --> 00:01:25,450
Any Monad app can launch a

31
00:01:25,450 --> 00:01:27,850
market with depth in one call.

32
00:01:27,850 --> 00:01:32,250
Loss limits are on-chain: one percent per market, eight in total.

33
00:01:32,250 --> 00:01:33,850
Users can always exit.

34
00:01:34,850 --> 00:01:37,087
I'm Nisarg, building this alone.

35
00:01:37,087 --> 00:01:39,771
It runs on testnet with test

36
00:01:39,771 --> 00:01:42,455
money, and no outside users yet.

37
00:01:42,455 --> 00:01:45,587
Mainnet needs Chainlink Data Streams, CRE deploy

38
00:01:45,587 --> 00:01:48,271
access, Kuru rights and an audit.

39
00:01:48,271 --> 00:01:51,850
Converge: a market maker for every short round.
